            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan style=\u0022font-size: 14pt;\u0022\u003ESantiago\u0027s sports and athletic programs are run by the Athletic Directors Jamie Valladares and Benjamin Tran. They can be reached at \u003C/span\u003E\u003Ca data-router-slot=\u0022disabled\u0022 href=\u0022mailto:jvalladares@ggusd.us\u0022 type=\u0022external\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan style=\u0022font-size: 14pt;\u0022\u003Ejvalladares@ggusd.us\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/a\u003E\u003Cspan style=\u0022font-size: 14pt;\u0022\u003E and \u003C/span\u003E\u003Ca data-router-slot=\u0022disabled\u0022 href=\u0022mailto:btran1@ggusd.us\u0022 type=\u0022external\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan style=\u0022font-size: 14pt;\u0022\u003Ebtran1@ggusd.us\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/a\u003E\u003Cspan style=\u0022font-size: 14pt;\u0022\u003E.\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan style=\u0022font-size: 16pt;\u0022\u003EAthletic Clearance\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan style=\u0022font-size: 14pt;\u0022\u003EEvery athlete must complete athletic clearance and receive written confirmation before the first camp, tryout, or practice. \u003C/span\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022/{localLink:c83307e2-20fc-492d-976e-25cfa1110545}\u0022 type=\u0022document\u0022 type=\u0022document\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan style=\u0022font-size: 14pt;\u0022\u003ESee the full Athletic Clearance page\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/a\u003E\u003Cspan style=\u0022font-size: 14pt;\u0022\u003E for the steps, physical, forms, and required documents.\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
